# Indian Restaurant Website Implementation Plan

## Goal Description
Create a premium, aesthetically stunning Indian style restaurant website. The restaurant name is currently a placeholder ("Changing Flavors" or dynamic). The site will feature online ordering capabilities, distinct categorization for Veg and Non-Veg items, and prominent links to Swiggy and Zomato for delivery integration.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> The restaurant name is noted as "changing" in the prompt. I will use "Changing Flavors" as a placeholder name. Please let me know if you have a specific name ready!
> I'll be using Vanilla HTML, CSS, and JS to create a highly optimized, custom-designed frontend unless you'd prefer a framework like React/Next.js.

## Proposed Changes

### Core Website Files
All files will be created in `C:\Users\mudda\.gemini\antigravity\scratch\indian_restaurant`

#### [NEW] [index.html](file:///C:/Users/mudda/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/indian_restaurant/index.html)
The main structure of the website. Semantic HTML5 including:
- Hero section with dynamic typography and call to action.
- Links to Swiggy and Zomato with their brand colors/icons.
- Menu section cleanly divided into Veg (green indicator) and Non-Veg (red indicator).
- Shopping cart / order summary section.

#### [NEW] [styles.css](file:///C:/Users/mudda/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/indian_restaurant/styles.css)
Premium aesthetic styling:
- Deep, rich Indian color palette (Saffron, Deep Red, Gold, Warm Charcoal).
- Glassmorphism effects for modern feel.
- Smooth scrolling and micro-animations on hover for menu items and buttons.
- Fully responsive design for mobile ordering.

#### [NEW] [script.js](file:///C:/Users/mudda/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/indian_restaurant/script.js)
Application logic:
- Menu data structure (Veg/Non-veg arrays).
- Dynamic rendering of menu items.
- Cart management (add to cart, update quantity, calculate total).

### Asset Generation
I will generate UI assets (images) of premium Indian food (Biryani, Butter Chicken, Paneer Tikka) using the AI generation tool to make the site look authentic and breathtaking.

## Verification Plan
### Manual Verification
- Render the site in the browser to ensure the rich aesthetic meets the premium standard.
- Test adding both Veg and Non-Veg items to the cart.
- Verify Swiggy and Zomato buttons are present and styled correctly.
